  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> Adjust and measure with »reamCheck« </h1>",
   "body": "<p>With »reamCheck«, you can set complete machining tools such as long reamers and fine boring tools fully automatically, quickly, accurately and independently of the operator. The integrated control measurement offers you the desired safety.</p> <p>The tailstock can be conveniently lowered using the operating handle and holds long, slim tools precisely in position with a defined contact pressure. Thanks to the outstanding ZOLLER technology, you can carry out all steps with ease and absolute process reliability. Whether you prefer to use a tactile measuring method for the setting process or rely on the proven ZOLLER »pilot« image processing technology is your choice.</p> <p>One thing is certain: it couldn't be better!</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/company/contact\">Inquire now</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/3/csm_reamcheck_detail_f4a6271a9a.webp",
