     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "Electronic measuring probe \"duo\"",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Electronic measuring probe \"duo\"</h3> <p>For simultaneously setting and measuring diameters and tapers of reamers, for example, using the oversize principle. The probes are magnetic and can be attached as required.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/f/csm_reamcheck_cnc_steuerung_c04de8e0a9.webp",
