     "h": 356,
     "title": "Automatic with CNC control",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Automatic with CNC control</h3> <p>Fast and CNC-controlled axial or radial run-out concentricity measurement on cutterheads or CAP milling cutters.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
